“Bha sin math,” ars esan, “carson nach do chum thu romhad?”

26:24.000 --> 26:25.000
“Uill nam biodh fhios, a shagairt,

26:25.000 --> 26:29.000
cho doirbh ’s a bha e dhomhsa siud a chur ri chèile,

26:29.000 --> 26:33.000
