27:22.000 --> 27:30.000
Agus ’s e fear à Uibhist a dh’ionnsaich dhomhsa na faclan sin.

27:30.000 --> 27:34.000
Ach dh’ionnsaich esan iad anns an Uibhist.

27:34.000 --> 27:36.000
Cò às a bha MacEadhmuinn?

27:38.000 --> 27:42.000
Bha, canaidh sinne, canaidh sinne …

27:48.000 --> 27:50.000
dè a-nis mar a chanas sinn ann am Beurla, East Bay,

27:50.000 --> 27:53.000
’s e bha, north side of East Bay.

27:53.000 --> 27:57.000
Am Bàigh an Ear, Am Bàigh an Ear, 

27:57.000 --> 27:59.000
taobh a tuath Am Bàigh an Ear ann an Gàidhlig.

27:59.000 --> 28:02.000
’S ann an sin a rugadh e?

28:00.000 --> 28:02.000
